   "id": "g22",
   "no": 22,
   "week": 8,
   "emoji": "♻️",
   "title": "will 決定同承諾",
   "en": "will for decisions",
   "reuse": null,
   "intro": [
    {
     "h": "臨時決定同承諾",
     "p": "<b>will</b> + 動詞原形。縮寫 <b>'ll</b>。否定 <b>won't</b>。",
     "ex": [
      [
       "I will recycle this bottle.",
       "我會回收呢個樽。"
      ],
      [
       "I'll help you.",
       "我會幫你。"
      ],
      [
       "We won't litter.",
       "我哋唔會亂拋垃圾。"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "同 going to 嘅分別",
     "p": "going to 多講早就計劃好。will 多講而家決定或者承諾。<br>而家先決定：I'll take the bus.",
     "ex": [
      [
       "I will turn off the light.",
       "我會關燈。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
